      "evidence": "Normal execute obtains and validates exact returned status enable=1,latch=1 after the durable observation, binds the status and exact receipt into cleanup-intent, dispatches cleanup only afterward, and then performs finalization with a fresh resident D0 health preflight. Source-order regression passed."
